    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "One rubric per license type, not per-examination (decision 84)",
      "items": [
        "Edited from a standalone Settings/Admin area outside any single examination's workspace, consistent with ADR-0020 treating it as a shared, versioned platform service — Lead/Approver access, no new admin role introduced for this alone",
        "The editor shows only the current version and a save-creates-new-version action — full version history stays queryable via the Audit Log tab if ever needed, without building a dedicated version browser (decision 110)"
      ]
